<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-003-A habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.182333" lon="-120.852695"><name>SC26-003-A</name><desc>Southern rock high Prominent local rock high southeast of the Diablo security zone. Terrain A 83/100; not catch probability. Center 101 ft; nearby 97–136 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. About 861 m from the Diablo security-zone boundary. Plan the full drift and approach outside it. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-025</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 225-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.1806664824971" lon="-120.85279372159334"/><trkpt lat="35.18066842897822" lon="-120.85290347325386"/><trkpt lat="35.180848645431176" lon="-120.85289873173255"/><trkpt lat="35.180860322308966" lon="-120.85355724336812"/><trkpt lat="35.181040538833514" lon="-120.85355250325622"/><trkpt lat="35.18104637596985" lon="-120.85388175994179"/><trkpt lat="35.18122659252724" lon="-120.85387702051356"/><trkpt lat="35.181232428808116" lon="-120.85420627801955"/><trkpt lat="35.181142320510794" lon="-120.85420864737601"/><trkpt lat="35.18115010080179" lon="-120.85464765704732"/><trkpt lat="35.1810938569219" lon="-120.85464913564667"/><trkpt lat="35.18178635762408" lon="-120.85507360025366"/><trkpt lat="35.18178669334333" lon="-120.85496033462219"/><trkpt lat="35.182057018335314" lon="-120.85495322884064"/><trkpt lat="35.18206032232656" lon="-120.85513971110598"/><trkpt lat="35.18237677559989" lon="-120.85516446515294"/><trkpt lat="35.183149311765085" lon="-120.85495609309405"/><trkpt